---
Title: Blocks Inside List Items
---

- A callout in an item:

  > [!note]
  > Callout prose & a hash # and code `#tag`.

- A theorem in an item:

  @begin(theorem)
  Theorem prose & a hash #.
  @end(theorem)

- A generic environment in an item:

  @begin(aside-note)
  Aside prose & a hash #.
  @end(aside-note)

- A tight item & #
  - nested & # too
